imax.io/docs/code/desktop/infinite-canvas.md): Bring your assets, ideas, and generated results onto one canvas, and create alongside your Agent.\nL11: - [Goal](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/goal.md): Set a verifiable outcome for MiniMax Code and let it keep working until the goal is achieved or progress is blocked.\nL12: - [Built-in Browser](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/browser.md): Open pages, preview generated HTML, and debug web work inside the MiniMax Code task view.\nL13: - [Computer Use](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/computer-use.md): Let MiniMax Code operate apps on your computer directly for tasks that need a graphical interface.\nL14: - [Files / Changes / Terminal Panels](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/panels.md): Use MiniMax Code panels to inspect files, code changes, and command output.\nL15: - [Appearance](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/appearance.md): Adjust the display mode, theme, density, fonts, and colors of MiniMax Code.\nL16: - [Shortcuts and Mini Window](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/shortcuts.md): Use global shortcuts, command palette, and the mini window to work faster.\nL17: - [Updates and Feedback](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/desktop/updates-feedback.md): Check for MiniMax Code updates and submit feedback tickets from the desktop app.\nL18: - [Agent Team](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/team.md): Use Agent Team for complex tasks that benefit from decomposition, collaboration, and verification.\nL19: - [Custom Agents](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/custom-agents.md): Create dedicated Agents with their own role, instructions, skills, workspace, and channels.\nL20: - [Custom Mini Apps](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/mini-apps.md): Bring information, tools, and everyday tasks together in one interface.\nL21: - [H3 Max Video Generation](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/h3-max.md): Create videos with sound from text prompts and reference media in MiniMax Code.\nL22: - [Plugin Marketplace](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/plugins.md): Install and use domain plugins in MiniMax Code.\nL23: - [MCP Servers](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/mcp.md): Connect external tools and data sources to MiniMax Code.\nL24: - [Memory](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/agents/memory.md): Let MiniMax Code retain useful preferences, project conventions, and long-term working patterns.\nL25: - [Scheduled Tasks](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/automation/schedules.md): Let Agents run recurring work on a schedule.\nL26: - [Remote Control](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/automation/remote-control.md): Connect to your desktop Agent from your phone to check progress, add instructions, and approve permissions.\nL27: - [Messaging Integrations](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/automation/im.md): Collaborate with Agents through Telegram, WeChat, Lark, or Feishu depending on the locale.\nL28: - [M Plan and Credits](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/account/usage.md): View your MiniMax Code subscription plan, credit balance, and usage quotas.\nL29: - [MiniMax API Key](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/account/minimax-api.md): Configure your own MiniMax API key in MiniMax Code.\nL30: - [Custom Models / BYOK](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/account/byok.md): Add a custom model provider with base URL, API key, API format, and model names.\nL31: - [Configure BYOK Models with an Agent](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/account/byok-agent-setup.md): Configure custom models with an agent and verify real responses using curl on macOS and Windows.\nL32: - [FAQ](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/help/faq.md): Frequently asked questions about MiniMax Code desktop.\nL33: - [Feedback](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/code/help/feedback.md): Submit reproduction details, screenshots, and diagnostics when reporting issues.\nL34: - [Quick Start](https://agent.minimax.io/docs/cli/quick-start.md): Install Mi